\#{ Facilitator dry-run protocol: one A4 page, loops and inserts only. Every string and number arrives finished from the print model (FLOW-05, D-07, D-25); the block rows keep a fixed height of 14 mm (at least 12 mm) so there is room to write, and the page ends with a fill report that the PDF test reads. }
